{\f1\fs22\b\cf1 1.  About VaultMate}\par
{\f1\fs18\cf1 VaultMate is a local-first credentials manager that stores passwords, API keys, and secrets exclusively on your own device. No data is transmitted to any server unless you explicitly configure cloud backup features.}\par
