{\f1\fs22\b\cf1 3.  Data Storage & Security}\par
{\f1\fs18\cf1 All credentials are encrypted on your local device using AES-256-GCM encryption before being written to disk. Your master PIN is never stored in plain text. VaultMate does not transmit your credentials, encryption keys, or PIN to any remote server.}\par
